<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fraser Alexander shrinks Enviroserv stake.</title>
<headline>Fraser Alexander shrinks Enviroserv stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Alexander Ltd said on Thursday it has diluted its share in Enviroserv Holdings Ltd to below 35 percent as undertaken to the Securities Regulation Panel.</p>
<p>It said the required Enviroserv shares have been placed with a selected financial institution.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
